│ shift-↑              select up                             Esc        cancel / close                                 │
│ shift-↓              select down                           Enter      submit                                         │
│ ctrl-shift-←         select the previous word              Tab        next field                                     │
│ ctrl-shift-→         select the next word                  shift-Tab  previous field                                 │
│ shift-Home           select to the start of the line       Space      next choice                                    │
│ shift-End            select to the end of the line         Backspace  delete the character before                    │
│ ctrl-a               select all                            Del        delete the character after                     │
│ Backspace            delete the character before                                                                     │
│ Del                  delete the character after            Command palette                                           │
│ ctrl-w               delete the word before                ctrl-q     quit                                           │
│ alt-d                delete the word after                 F1         show / hide the help                           │
│ ctrl-k               delete to the end of the line         ctrl-p     command palette                                │
│ ctrl-z               undo                                  ↑ ctrl-k   up                                             │
│ ctrl-y ctrl-shift-z  redo                                  ↓ ctrl-j   down                                           │
